        }
      ],
      "content": "SP 81 SW           STOKE MANDEVILLE             LOWER ROAD                                                 s.w. side 4/129                                           No.3. Manor Cottage II Small house. Early C18. Brick with old tile roof, flanking chimneys, 2 hipped dormers with old leaded glazing. 2 storeys and attic, 3 bays, with central modern open tiled porch, 1-light window above flanked by cross mullioned and transomed windows with old leaded glazing. 3-light casements to ground floor with cambered brick arches, leaded glazing. Tiled rear wing with hipped dormer. (Flank wall said to carry date 1717). Listing NGR: SP8327610426"
    }
